hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1105","(134) Ladai ke liye saf bandi aur (sawari se) utarne ke bare mein jo warid hua us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nufaili ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Bara ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: pas woh utre aur madad talab ki - ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) - phir unhon ne kaha: main Nabi hun, jhoot nahin, main Ibn Abd al-Muttalib hun, phir unhon ne apne sahaba ki saf bandi ki."
